{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wendi-e-o034b","title":"立郭氏皇后并赐爵赈谷","accounts":[{"id":"wendi-e-o034b-account","label":"《文帝纪》正文","text":"立郭氏皇后并赐爵赈谷","evidence":["wendi-e-o034b-q"]},{"id":"houfei-e-o036a-account","label":"《后妃传》正文","text":"黄初三年：曹丕不从谏立郭氏为后","evidence":["houfei-e-o036a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wendi-p0021","role":"受立","evidence":["wendi-e-o034b-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0170","role":"立后","evidence":["houfei-e-o036a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":222,"label":"黄初三年九月庚子","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"wendi-y222","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"wendi-q-o028","basis":"黄初三年九月庚子"},"evidence":["wendi-e-o034b-q","wendi-q-o028","wendi-q-b-ffbd612d6e6a445d21d8"]},"ordering_evidence":"wendi-e-o034b-q","source_order":[2,322,"O034b"],"order":613}],"persons":[{"id":"wendi-p0021","name":"郭皇后（曹丕后）","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0170","name":"曹丕","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"houfei-e-o036a-q","section":"chapter-005","block":"b-b38e77b1ca3bf1c868cd","layer":"original","quote":"文帝不从，遂立为皇后。﹝二﹞","section_title":"后妃传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0015.xhtml","index":157,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":14,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wendi-e-o034b-q","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-a982c7b5a54056e31695","layer":"original","quote":"庚子〖7〗，立皇后郭氏〖8〗。赐天下男子爵，人二级；鳏、寡、笃癃及贫不能自存者赐谷〖9〗。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":321,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":91,"end":136,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wendi-q-b-ffbd612d6e6a445d21d8","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-ffbd612d6e6a445d21d8","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗三年：黄初三年（公元 222 ）。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":287,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-2c01bc8dd8508fc686e1","start":0,"end":20,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wendi-q-o028","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-9204f4c854f659a541df","layer":"original","quote":"三年春正月〖1〗，丙寅朔，日有食之。庚午〖2〗，行幸许昌宫。诏曰：“今之计、（考）〔孝〕〖3〗，古之贡士也。十室之邑，必有忠信。若限年然后取士〖4〗，是吕尚、周晋不显于前世也〖5〗。其令郡国所选，勿拘老幼；儒通经术，吏达文法〖6〗，到，皆试用。有司纠故不以实者〖7〗。”﹝一﹞","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":281,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":138,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
